Z||000000||Frank Sombers||05-30-2001||10:14 PM||||Although it is sometime in the future I wanted to make you aware of the plans for the 2nd Annual Pontiac Show. This years event will be held:<P>When? Sunday, October 7, 2001<BR>      10:00 AM - 3:00 PM<P>Where? Star Pontiac<BR>       Route 33 and Hecktown Road<BR>       Easton, Pa. <P>Sponsor? The GTO Association of Pa.<P>Contacts? Greg at (908) 537-2116<BR>                 or<BR>          Curt at (610) 253-1064<P>This event is open to all Pontiacs. Last year there were only 3 Fieros present, and one of club members told me they would welcome as many Fieros as possible. Perhaps we can get a group to travel together to this years show? <P>    ||||reg||1
